{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39509","headline":"边将二首 二 · 张蠙","name":"边将二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"按劒立城楼，西看极海头。\n承家爲上将，开地得边州。\n碛迥兵难伏，天寒马易收。\n胡风一度猎，吹裂锦貂裘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张蠙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39509.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39509","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}